1
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,519
Lingguo Temple.

2
00:01:06,239 --> 00:01:07,760
I want you to go to the Empress

3
00:01:07,799 --> 00:01:09,560
and ask the Emperor for an imperial edict.

4
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,280
Imperial edict?

5
00:01:11,599 --> 00:01:13,840
Now the Second Prince hates me to the bone.

6
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:15,840
I can't stay at Prince Rui's Mansion for long.

7
00:01:15,959 --> 00:01:17,040
I need to find a way to get out of here.

8
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:18,640
In a few days,

9
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,280
I will make a risky move.

10
00:01:20,879 --> 00:01:21,959
It may alarm the palace

11
00:01:22,519 --> 00:01:23,400
[and may upset Consort Ling]

12
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:24,640
[and even His Majesty.]

13
00:01:25,439 --> 00:01:26,079
[At that time,]

14
00:01:26,519 --> 00:01:28,000
[I need Your Majesty to intervene]

15
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,560
[and persuade His Majesty]

16
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:31,079
[to send me to Lingguo Temple.]

17
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:34,120
We've come full circle back here.

18
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:38,959
Let's go.

19
00:01:42,159 --> 00:01:45,040
You mentioned that Princess Consort Rui knew the Imperial Consort Dowager,

20
00:01:45,719 --> 00:01:47,599
and now she's been sent to Lingguo Temple.

21
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,760
It's probably not a coincidence, right?

22
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,760
I once asked my mother.

23
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:56,120
She clearly doesn't know Shen Suhe at all.

24
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,000
How does Shen Suhe

25
00:01:58,439 --> 00:02:00,200
know about my mother?

26
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:02,959
We should increase the guard

27
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,040
of my mother's yard.

28
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:06,560
As for Shen Suhe,

29
00:02:07,239 --> 00:02:08,759
the Second Prince won't give up.

30
00:02:09,599 --> 00:02:11,319
Wait for a while before taking action.

31
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,960
Miss, slow down.

32
00:02:17,479 --> 00:02:17,960
Slow down.

33
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:26,759
This is the room arranged for you by the abbot.

34
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,919
It's different from the mansion.

35
00:02:29,159 --> 00:02:31,280
Please bear with it.

36
00:02:32,639 --> 00:02:33,879
Although it looks simple,

37
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,800
everything you need is here.

38
00:02:36,319 --> 00:02:37,520
Thank you for your consideration.

39
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:38,759
I appreciate it.

40
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,280
I'm Wu Xin.

41
00:02:41,599 --> 00:02:43,240
If you need anything,

42
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:45,199
you can come to me in the front yard.

43
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,800
Miss, you are badly hurt,

44
00:02:57,439 --> 00:02:58,639
and you have to live in such a place.

45
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,159
They are really too much.

46
00:03:01,879 --> 00:03:02,599
It's okay.

47
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:05,280
It's better than losing your life in the mansion.

48
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:06,879
Go.

49
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,039
Find some water.

50
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,120
Let's wash up.

51
00:03:32,719 --> 00:03:33,319
Are you okay?

52
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:34,639
I'm fine.

53
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,080
You're hurt.

54
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:46,439
Let me pull it out for you.

55
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:50,479
Don't worry about me.

56
00:03:51,199 --> 00:03:52,360
Take care of your own injuries.

57
00:03:54,319 --> 00:03:55,039
All settled.

58
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:56,240
Two got away.

59
00:03:56,759 --> 00:03:57,599
We've sent someone to chase them.

60
00:03:59,159 --> 00:04:00,840
Their target is clear,

61
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,599
