62
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,080
Remember to apply medicine.

63
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:09,240
Mr.

64
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:11,000
Wang.

65
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,080
He got shot.

66
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,159
The arrow is poisonous.

67
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:15,560
Poisonous?

68
00:04:32,519 --> 00:04:33,439
