76
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,199
That gentleman didn't lie to me.

77
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,600
What gentleman?

78
00:04:53,519 --> 00:04:54,199
It's

79
00:04:54,279 --> 00:04:55,879
