83
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,000
Where are they?

84
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,199
In the yard.

85
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,639
Miss,

86
00:05:13,639 --> 00:05:14,399
have you

87
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,480
recovered from the poison?

88
00:05:17,319 --> 00:05:18,759
Do you think everyone is like you,

89
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,680
stubbornly enduring punishment?

90
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:33,600
You...

91
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,000
blocked the poisoned arrow for me

92
00:05:35,519 --> 00:05:36,519
and gave me medicine.

93
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:37,720
I owe you,

94
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:40,040
and I'll repay you when I have the chance.

95
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,519
Why are you in Lingguo Temple?

96
00:05:46,519 --> 00:05:47,680
How can I find you?

97
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:51,160
Did you know you would be expelled here?

98
00:05:51,639 --> 00:05:53,279
Or did you plan it step by step?

99
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:56,879
The process is not important.

100
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:59,199
What matters is that I'm here.

101
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:02,000
And Consort Dowager Li is also here.

102
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,959
What I told you before

103
00:06:06,279 --> 00:06:07,399
about Consort Dowager Li

104
00:06:08,279 --> 00:06:09,279
is all true.

105
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:11,920
I'll figure it out.

106
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,040
But

107
00:06:13,639 --> 00:06:15,199
