117
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:38,920
Find two or three reliable ones

118
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,160
and bring them to me.

119
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,079
Okay.

120
00:06:41,279 --> 00:06:41,879
I'll go right away.

121
00:06:53,279 --> 00:06:53,720
Please.

122
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:55,800
Thank you.

123
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:02,800
Brother.

124
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,160
Brother.

125
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:06,920
