131
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:30,720
Don't worry.

132
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,360
He is reliable.

133
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,360
And

134
00:07:35,319 --> 00:07:36,600
I have become an enemy

135
