140
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:51,680
refusing to lend a hand.

141
00:07:53,759 --> 00:07:56,000
I know you never liked court struggles,

142
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,120
so you sought a position in the Hanlin Academy.

143
00:07:58,759 --> 00:07:59,680
But compared to me,

144
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:02,079
