147
00:08:06,519 --> 00:08:07,439
Actually, over the years,

148
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:10,399
I've just feigned indifference in the Hanlin Academy.

149
00:08:10,759 --> 00:08:12,319
maintaining a neutral stance in the court.

150
00:08:13,199 --> 00:08:13,879
But secretly,

151
00:08:14,279 --> 00:08:15,360
I have been helping my father investigate

152
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,519
the evidence of the Second Prince's crimes.

153
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:19,399
He has been threatening and bribing people,

154
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,720
forming cliques for personal gain.

155
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,040
If we can present these to Your Majesty,

156
00:08:23,839 --> 00:08:24,480
maybe

157
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:26,240
we can save my father's life for the time being.

158
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:31,040
So my father knew about the Second Prince's evil deeds long ago.

159
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,120
Then why did he...

160
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:33,720
Why

161
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,960
to marry Prince Rui?

162
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,679
Father was forced to do so.

163
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,919
His Majesty has made up his mind.

164
00:08:41,879 --> 00:08:43,200
If father refuses,

165
00:08:43,879 --> 00:08:45,600
he will be stripped of his position.

166
00:08:46,679 --> 00:08:47,559
You know father.

167
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:50,200
He is not a power-hungry person.

168
00:08:51,919 --> 00:08:53,960
He just can't watch the Second Prince

169
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,120
continue to cause chaos in the imperial court.

170
00:08:57,759 --> 00:08:58,759
You don't need to say more.

171
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,279
No matter how wrong father is,

172
00:09:01,799 --> 00:09:03,600
