173
00:09:04,519 --> 00:09:05,559
The most important thing now

174
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:07,159
is to clear father's

175
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,440
and the Prime Minister's Residence's

176
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,759
name.

177
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:14,600
The man at the door,

178
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:16,960
Young Master Lou,

179
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:18,759
what's wrong with him?

180
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,240
Although I haven't interacted much with him,

181
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:22,720
I can

182
00:09:22,879 --> 00:09:25,159
sense he is no ordinary person.

183
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:28,080
Maybe he can meet my father.

184
00:09:29,519 --> 00:09:30,200
Before that,

185
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,720
we have found a lot of

186
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,840
evidence against the Second Prince.

187
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:36,360
Except for those destroyed by him on the day of confiscation,

188
00:09:37,159 --> 00:09:38,440
there are some more important ones

189
00:09:38,639 --> 00:09:39,720
hidden away.

190
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,639
As for where they are hidden,

191
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,759
only my father knows.

192
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,320
Only my father knows.

193
00:10:04,639 --> 00:10:05,480
I want to see my father.

194
00:10:06,279 --> 00:10:07,120
To break into the prison,

195
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,559
