198
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,080
I can.

199
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,159
Of course,

200
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,360
with you.

201
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:23,559
Alright.

202
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:35,720
But the smoke won't last long,

203
00:10:35,919 --> 00:10:36,639
so we need to hurry.

204
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:37,759
Which one?

205
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:38,960
According to my investigation during the day,

206
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:39,879
