211
00:11:55,399 --> 00:11:55,879
Sui'er.

212
00:11:56,279 --> 00:11:56,720
Sui'er.

213
00:11:57,159 --> 00:11:57,639
Sui'er.

214
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:00,200
Sui'er.

215
00:12:06,279 --> 00:12:06,840
Sui'er.

216
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:07,679
Sui'er!

217
00:12:08,519 --> 00:12:08,879
Sui'er!

218
00:12:09,559 --> 00:12:10,240
Wake up, Sui'er!

219
00:12:15,159 --> 00:12:15,559
Sui'er!

220
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:17,240
Sui'er!

221
00:12:17,799 --> 00:12:18,320
Go get the doctor!

222
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,039
Yes.

223
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:20,639
Sui'er!

224
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:22,759
Sui'er!

225
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:24,960
It's okay.

226
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:27,279
Why did you take the arrow for me?

227
00:12:29,159 --> 00:12:30,559
You once blocked one for me,

228
00:12:31,759 --> 00:12:33,039
so I just

229
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,679
