239
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:01,200
Sui'er.

240
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:01,960
Don't sleep.

241
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:03,799
Sui'er.

242
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:04,960
Sui'er.

243
00:13:08,399 --> 00:13:09,480
