274
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:57,080
I'll go make the medicine.

275
00:15:19,919 --> 00:15:20,919
Don't leave me.

276
00:15:22,039 --> 00:15:22,399
Don't.

277
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:24,080
Don't worry.

278
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:24,600
Don't.

279
00:15:25,279 --> 00:15:25,799
